        <mxCell id="102" value="&lt;b&gt;Review &amp; Override&lt;/b&gt;&#10;Approve / Reject&#10;Provide Feedback&#10;&#10;LangGraph interrupt pauses the graph. ADK surfaces the human task. No eRA / Office of Research Aid payload is sent until HITL clears the readiness gate." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#FCE8E6;strokeColor=#EA4335;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
